# ============================================================
# Spring Boot | Java | DDD | BDD | TDD
# Maven / Gradle | IntelliJ / VS Code / Eclipse
# Coloque este arquivo na raiz do repositorio.
# ============================================================

# --- Java: arquivos compilados e diagnosticos ---
*.class
*.log
*.hprof
hs_err_pid*
replay_pid*
*.jfr

# --- Maven (incluindo modulos aninhados) ---
**/target/
**/pom.xml.tag
**/pom.xml.releaseBackup
**/pom.xml.versionsBackup
**/pom.xml.next
**/release.properties
**/dependency-reduced-pom.xml
**/buildNumber.properties
**/.mvn/timing.properties

# --- Gradle (incluindo modulos aninhados) ---
.gradle/
**/build/
!**/src/**/build/
**/gradle-app.setting
**/.gradletasknamecache

# NAO ignorar os wrappers do Maven e do Gradle:
# mvnw, mvnw.cmd, .mvn/wrapper/, gradlew, gradlew.bat,
# gradle/wrapper/gradle-wrapper.jar e *.properties do wrapper.

